  "title": "Acorn Squash with Apple",
  "description": "This acorn squash with apple recipe is easy to cook in the microwave with butter, brown sugar, cinnamon, and walnuts for a warm, comforting side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Ed Haley"
  ],
